er, carrots and most of the green onions to the sauce. Toss with tongs until every strand is coated, loosening with a little more of the reserved water if the sauce seems thick.","uses":[10,11,12]},{"text":"Pile into bowls and top with the remaining green onions, the sesame seeds and the peanuts. Serve cold or at room temperature, with more sriracha on the side.","uses":[12,13,14,9]}]}